  {
   "id": "r3",
   "type": "stanza_note",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "closely alike is Vîracharita p. 110. (Trith.) न कम्पन्ते झञ्झामरुति कि-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "ल वाति प्रतिदिशम् । समुन्मूर्च्छत्साराः कुलशिखरिणः किंचिदपि ते । न मर्यादां तेपि प्रतिज-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "हति गाम्भीर्यगरिमस्फुरद्वाभ्रभ्राणीकलितमहिमानोम्बुनिधयः ॥ .—Hâriṇî.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "type": "stanza_note",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "St. XXI.—भुजयोरन्तरम् = bosom. करवाळकररुह must be analysed",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "in two different ways when going with वनिता and with श्रीः.—“ sword-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "like nails” and “ nail-like sword.”—Âryâ.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "type": "stanza_note",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "St. XXII.—One of the moon’s names is ओषधीश. For the story",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "of his getting that position see Matsyapurâṇa XXIII., 10-13. शत-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "भिषक् = one hundred physicians, and a constellation of that name.",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "See Varâhamihira (by Kern.) Chap. CV., 4.—Mâlinî.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "id": "r6",
   "type": "stanza_note",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "St. XXIII.—इति = इत्येतत्सर्वम्. अनुस्यूते = woven. विच्छिन्ने = broken",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "off, rent down. दिशोदृश्यताम् should be, I think, दृशोदृश्यताम्. As it",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "stands it must be interpreted to mean “ goes in all directions and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "becomes invisible.” The construction required for this mean-",
     "end": "hyphen"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "ing, however, is not a good one.—S'ârdûlavikrîḍita.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "uncertain": false,
   "note": null
  }
 ],
